This project uses, unmodified, the audio encoder of EmbeddingGemma 2
(google/embeddinggemma-2, revision 914f7f89142e33e77833254d9c9b90c3cef7303b),
Copyright Google LLC, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The released
model package includes that audio encoder in encoder/model.safetensors: every
audio_tower tensor of the checkpoint, with its values unchanged and the "audio_tower."
prefix removed from its name. The rest of the checkpoint (the text and vision parts
and the audio embedding projection) is not included. Google's model card asks that
deployments adhere to the Gemma Prohibited Use Policy
(https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy).

indicear/resources/english_words.tsv is derived from SCOWL (Spell Checker Oriented
Word Lists); its copyright notice and licence are in
indicear/resources/SCOWL-LICENSE.txt.

The released model was trained on third-party speech datasets under CC BY (2.0–4.0)
and CC0 terms; sources, revisions and attributions are listed in docs/data-licenses.md
and in the model card.
